{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5d5eff05881bc93abb89febc7cf4b43c12998b8809cb77c4323fe0605e60db24","ja":"思いをはせる冬の旅","zh":"寄托思念的冬日之旅","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1c2ec907043a328e889dd57875deb7b5183bfb1c9bd163f1604c02301bffe898","ja":"ええと……紬ちゃん。\nうらやましいって、どういうことですか？","zh":"呃……小紬。\n你说羡慕，是什么意思？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"219e339123e10ce77cec093b837f3ea4386f3e1a56fbe787edbbce72a86b1454","ja":"私の故郷、金沢までは新幹線で1本とはいえ、\nみなさんを気軽にご招待できる距離ではありません。","zh":"虽然乘新干线到我的故乡金泽要坐1趟，  \n但也不是能让大家轻松前来做客的距离。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5b383f242a346956f33ff74d82568b104d895c87c32e93a3ffb00f3ee927a3e6","ja":"ですからおふたりのように、すぐにご近所や\nご自分のお家に招待できるのがうらやましくて……。","zh":"所以我很羡慕你们两位那样，能马上邀请邻居或到自己家里去……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e5f7d592600f4b964aeff9d5be58bfdde36d946641839a2bf4a28b2134e1ca29","ja":"そっか～。それって、わたしにとっては当たり前のこと\nでしたけど……紬さんにとっては違いますもんね。","zh":"这样啊～。对我来说，那是理所当然的事……但对纺小姐来说就不一样了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c201fad3900bb731a5df649807aaa42b5e961f401ff092cf140d2039e1e763f6","ja":"ええ。お土産だけでは伝えられない、\r\n地元の良さもいっぱいありますから。","zh":"是的。因为还有很多光靠土特产无法传达的家乡魅力。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"cd8701797f55e4970bfb7819482788d4abfaca337d8d9dadca079bb409565ed8","ja":"紬ちゃん、もしありさたちに金沢案内してくれるなら、\nどこに連れて行ってくれますか！？","zh":"小紬，如果你愿意带亚利沙她们逛金泽，会带我们去哪里呢！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f7f62962455331e724feaba2b906f82e871b2f8f613a5b99eab8a0f4631fcf22","ja":"そうですね……やはり、まずは兼六園でしょうか。\n雪が積もった様は特に美しく。","zh":"是啊……果然还是先去兼六园吧。\n积雪覆盖的景色尤其美丽。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"70d915d422a5144bb919334423b1732c73afd3af7b60d978623f13c61610c3d9","ja":"ふおおお～！　紬ちゃんと行く冬の金沢ツアー！\n絶対にほかほかで幸せいっぱいの旅まちがいなしです！","zh":"呜哦哦哦～！和小紬一起去冬日金泽旅行！绝对是一场暖融融、幸福满满的旅程！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c87d6d1052a4ff85f7543687d865e098a9a0ef625342ab31257645fce685768c","ja":"うん、楽しそう～！　あ、あと、\n紬さんのおうちの呉服屋さんにも行ってみたいな～！","zh":"嗯，听起来很有意思～！啊，还有，我也想去紬小姐家开的和服店看看～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"45cc1310f94d116835f139744c6cb8ef883044698f2fdfb41741039ec9f6e5fe","ja":"きれいなお着物、たくさんあるんですよね？\nわたしに似合うの選んでくださ～い♪","zh":"这么漂亮的和服，有很多对吧？\n请帮我选一件适合我的～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"5c87df8d336159b4d51fab51aa8085455e4fa45c87b2395b27503b1362419ee4","ja":"ありさは、そのお姿を撮りたいです！\nそのためなら金沢まで飛んでいきますよ！","zh":"亚利沙想拍下那个身姿！  \n为此的话，飞到金泽也没问题！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4a4c19ddf55e31bdaa4f1b40c04498fa4f4dddec15a196b4140e8d6650abe10f","ja":"いえ、飛行機ではなく新幹線ですが……。","zh":"不，是新干线，不是飞机……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"80dafb377bf698a15a1791ed7bc1a5164d132eb71646029a1ccae4032df132df","ja":"はい！　新幹線で金沢へ行きます！　紬ちゃん、\nそのときはいっぱい金沢を案内してください！","zh":"好的！我会坐新干线去金泽！阿䌷，到时候请带我好好逛逛金泽！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_983.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4523ce442e5f323e6c6212f72f09331003ca2807d39a03ce10c0e75de8c0d7f7","ja":"ええ、もちろんです。みなさんと一緒に歩く金沢……\n想像するだけで、ドキドキしてきます。ふふっ。","zh":"是的，当然可以。和大家一起漫步金泽……光是想象一下，就让我心跳加速了。呵呵。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
